klist for Charlotte-area homeowners—from the first storm concern through the carrier inspection and written roofing scope.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button button-gold" href="/roof-insurance-claim-charlotte-nc#claim-form">Request a free inspection →</a><a class="button button-ghost" href="tel:+19808005991">Call Majestic</a></div></div></section><section class="resource-body section" id="checklist"><div class="site-shell resource-grid"><aside><span>MAJESTIC</span><strong>VISIT GUIDE</strong><p>Factual roofing information for homeowners in Charlotte, NC and the surrounding Carolinas.</p></aside><div class="resource-sections"><article><span>01</span><div><h2>Before the appointment</h2><ul><li>Confirm the adjuster’s date, arrival window and contact information.</li><li>Ask the carrier whether your roofing contractor may attend the property visit.</li><li>Keep the claim number, carrier contact and accurate event or discovery timeline together.</li><li>Save storm photos, interior water-stain photos, temporary-repair photos, invoices and receipts.</li><li>Do not climb onto a wet, damaged or unstable roof. Let qualified parties inspect safely.</li></ul></div></article><article><span>02</span><div><h2>During the visit</h2><ul><li>Answer policy and claim questions accurately; do not guess or change dates.</li><li>Show the adjuster the areas where you first noticed water, debris or visible damage.</li><li>When scheduled and permitted, Majestic may point out documented roof conditions and explain the contractor’s written construction scope.</li><li>The carrier’s adjuster independently evaluates cause, policy terms, coverage and payment.</li><li>Ask how and when the carrier’s written estimate or decision will be delivered.</li></ul></div></article><article><span>03</span><div><h2>After the visit</h2><ul><li>Request and keep the carrier’s written estimate, correspondence and decision documents.</li><li>Review the physical construction scope against Majestic’s measurements and written estimate.</li><li>Direct policy, deductible, ACV, RCV, depreciation and coverage questions to the carrier or a licensed insurance professional.</li><li>If factual construction items differ, Majestic may prepare contractor documentation or a supplement for review.</li><li>Do not begin permanent work until the written construction agreement and project path are clear.</li></ul></div></article></div></div></section><section class="resource-documents section" id="documents"><div class="site-shell scope-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">Majestic documentation</p><h2>What the roofing record may include.</h2><p>The final package depends on what was inspected, what work was authorized and what the carrier or homeowner requested.</p></div><ul><li>Timestamped or organized roof photographs when available</li><li>Roof measurements and affected-slope identification</li><li>Written roofing estimate or contractor scope</li><li>Product and component information</li><li>Temporary protection documentation and receipts</li><li>Factual scope clarification when requested</li></ul></div></section><section class="resource-callout"><div class="site-shell"><strong>!</strong><p>Majestic does not coach homeowners to hide facts, interpret coverage or pressure an adjuster. The goal is a complete, accurate roofing record.</p></div></section><section class="resource-cta section"><div class="site-shell"><p class="eyebrow">Next step</p><h2>Start with a free roof inspection.</h2><a class="button button-gold" href="/roof-insurance-claim-charlotte-nc#claim-form">Open the roof request form →</a></div></section><footer class="claim-footer"><div class="site-shell"><a href="/" class="brand brand-footer"><span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span><strong>MAJESTIC</strong><small>ROOFING, INC.</small></span></a><p>Roof documentation is not public-adjuster, policy or legal advice.</p><a href="tel:+19808005991">(980) 800-5991</a></div></footer></main>
